      "class": "page-hero"
    },
    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span>\n    <span class=\"time\">25 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip\">Domain pattern</span>\n    <span class=\"chip\">Tier 3</span>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Specification (Composable Filters)</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Turn each business rule (\"seats at least 7\", \"price at most 3,500\", \"age over 18\") into a small object with one method, <code>isSatisfiedBy</code>, and build bigger rules with <code>and</code>, <code>or</code> and <code>not</code>. The answer to every \"search with filters\" and \"coupon eligibility\" question, and the idea behind <code>find</code>, tcpdump filters and iptables matches.</p>\n"
  },
